difficulty: easy
tags: CSO, steam, reheat
title: CSO Reheat Quick Guide
description: Easy settings for reheating your favorite dishes in a Sub-Zero Wolf steam oven. The steam-assisted reheat mode requires no oven preheat, and does not dry out your food like a dry oven, or ruining the texture and experience like a microwave.
---

= Chicken =

Fried Chicken: Preheat on Convection Steam 350°F. Cook breasts ~{5%minutes} before adding other pieces. Cook up to ~{20%minutes} total. For crispy skin, finish on (dry) Convection mode for ~{5%minutes}.

Chicken Wings: To-do.

